('Tiki Taka Football Academy & Turf', 'sports', 'Chennai', 'Kilpauk, T. Nagar, Velachery, Ampa Skywalk, Injambakkam & Mogappair West', 2, NULL, NULL, array['Football','Turf Rental','Kids Academy','Floodlit'], 'Multi-branch football turf and academy chain with open-air and indoor floodlit 4v4/5v5 fields, AC viewing gallery, and a Toddlers Turf Camp for young kids. Turf rental ₹1,000-2,000/hour, Toddlers Camp ₹2,000/month.', true),
